{"author":"schacon@gmail.com","body":"Implemented lifecycle split into status and state. New tickets now default to open:new, JSON output and schema include both fields, legacy stored states are inferred, and filtering/prefix resolution use status=open for active tickets. Updated ti state and added ti status to accept status, state, or status:state values, including closed => closed:resolved and closed:wontfix. Updated TUI lifecycle transitions, rendering, README, website Markdown/HTML, and agent help. Added unit and CLI integration tests and verified with cargo test."}